\description{
Computes the maximum likelihood estimator (MLE) of the drift \eqn{\mu} and
the diffusion coefficient \eqn{\sigma} of the Wiener process
\eqn{X_t = \mu t + \sigma B_t}, where \eqn{B} is a standard Brownian motion,
